{"version":1,"content":"<p>【30 年的 Bug 😓】資安研究員 Clyde 近日發表了一個關於「Windows 讀取 Video CD (VCD) 竟導致 Windows Explorer 檔案總管當機癱瘓」的 Bug。</p><p>這個離奇的 Bug 跨越近 30 年，由最早期的 Windows 95 到今天的 Windows 11 依然存在，是一直深植於作業系統底層的歷史遺留缺陷。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T04:42:31.445375+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T04:27:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T15:58:21.326829+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T04:38:39.553143+00:00","content_hash":"33522b41acb3604f6d5a8d0604b59b73cc5a09e0d5360008945f2d670a9c1f1b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}